url: 'https://github.com/epu-ntua/BuildON-SRI-Tools'
abstract: >-
  The Smart Readiness Indicator (SRI) provides a harmonised
  framework for assessing how effectively buildings use
  smart technologies to improve energy performance,
  occupant comfort, and grid flexibility. This repository
  contains two integrated tools: (i) an SRI Calculator that
  automates the end-to-end SRI assessment workflow and
  visualises results across domains, impact criteria, and
  key functionalities, and (ii) the Smart Building
  Readiness (SMURF) Assessment Tool, which transforms
  baseline SRI assessments into costed upgrade scenarios
  aligned with user-defined targets. The tools are
  integrated through a web-based workflow that enables
  continuity from assessment to upgrade planning.
